WEBVTT

00:00:00.606 --> 00:00:04.256
Hot in Cleveland is recording
in front of a live studio audio.

00:00:05.196 --> 00:00:07.340
Airplane mirrors aren't accurate,
are they?

00:00:07.508 --> 00:00:09.342
Of course not.

00:00:12.496 --> 00:00:13.496
Excuse me,

00:00:13.848 --> 00:00:15.093
- are you...
- Yes.

00:00:15.218 --> 00:00:18.416
I am Victoria Chase.
One tries to be inconspicuous.

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:21.285
Yes. That hat screams, "ignore me."

00:00:23.327 --> 00:00:25.276
Some fans are reluctant
to approach me

00:00:25.401 --> 00:00:27.450
<i>Ever since the edge of tomorrow
was canceled.</i>

00:00:27.575 --> 00:00:29.861
Playing Honor Saint raven
for the past 27 years

00:00:29.986 --> 00:00:32.611
Has been a privilege
and it is always so gratifying

00:00:32.736 --> 00:00:35.486
To meet those that
I have moved and touched.

00:00:36.495 --> 00:00:39.622
Actually, what I was going to ask was,
"are you comfortable?"

00:00:41.111 --> 00:00:43.292
No, but I will be when you
bring me a drink.

00:00:43.471 --> 00:00:45.294
- Champagne, three.
- Right away.

00:00:45.749 --> 00:00:48.099
Okay, Victoria, put away your phone.

00:00:48.309 --> 00:00:50.033
Joy, put away your spreadsheets,

00:00:50.158 --> 00:00:52.408
I want to have a toast.
Thank you.

00:00:53.065 --> 00:00:54.720
Here's to number 122.

00:00:54.889 --> 00:00:57.598
Cash in your miles and fly
to Paris with your best friends.

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:02.061
- This is gonna be fun.
- Yes.

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:07.548
I'm gonna get a napkin.
Be right back.

00:01:11.855 --> 00:01:13.114
Anders is on the plane.

00:01:13.492 --> 00:01:14.865
Your husband, Anders?

00:01:15.143 --> 00:01:16.143
Oh my God!

00:01:16.702 --> 00:01:19.036
Just calm down. You didn't know
he was going to Paris?

00:01:19.205 --> 00:01:21.706
We haven't spoken in months.
Our lawyers told us.

00:01:21.874 --> 00:01:23.666
Your lawyers are right.
Ignore him.

00:01:24.219 --> 00:01:26.627
It's just a hideous coincidence.

00:01:28.642 --> 00:01:32.383
But what if it's not a coincidence?
What if he's missing me too?

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:34.969
And Los Angeles was filled
with so many sad memories,

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:38.044
He's flying to Paris
to fill a void in his life?

00:01:39.094 --> 00:01:42.226
What if this is our "meet on top of the
empire state building" moment?

00:01:42.395 --> 00:01:44.562
<i>Have you been watching
sleepless in Seattle again?</i>

00:01:47.468 --> 00:01:49.668
But I got it down to once a month.

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:52.445
- I was up for a part in that movie.
- Of course you were.

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:55.156
Igo talk to him.

00:01:55.521 --> 00:01:58.658
Remember, romantic comedies
are like cellulite cures.

00:01:58.783 --> 00:02:00.633
Every one of them is a lie.

00:02:03.178 --> 00:02:04.478
Oh, my goodness.

00:02:05.998 --> 00:02:07.548
- Melanie.
- Anders.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:11.297
I didn't see you get on the plane.
What a surprise.

00:02:11.465 --> 00:02:14.715
You're the one full of surprises.
Traveling to Europe,

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:17.219
reading fiction,
and drinking club soda?

00:02:17.882 --> 00:02:20.347
I know. Where's your workaholic drunk
of a husband?

00:02:20.868 --> 00:02:22.818
I'm divorcing him, but you...

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:26.074
Hi, I'm Kim.

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:38.533
I haven't even gone on a date yet
And he's taking his fianc�e to Paris.

00:02:39.265 --> 00:02:40.715
And she's so young.

00:02:41.742 --> 00:02:43.270
She's half my age.

00:02:43.539 --> 00:02:45.938
Darling,
that really isn't that young.

00:02:46.575 --> 00:02:47.875
My fake age.

00:02:48.043 --> 00:02:49.939
Oh, my God. She's a child.

00:02:51.005 --> 00:02:54.131
I say we kill him and make
his underage whore watch.

00:02:55.225 --> 00:02:58.484
Listen, I know how painful this is,
but maybe...

00:02:58.609 --> 00:03:01.501
maybe this is your chance
to finally move on.

00:03:01.988 --> 00:03:04.142
Mel, you deserve so much better.

00:03:04.393 --> 00:03:05.493
She's right.

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:07.978
You're the kindest, most loving
person in the world.

00:03:08.265 --> 00:03:10.648
I hope the plane crashes
and kills them both.

00:03:12.272 --> 00:03:13.422
Make it stop!

00:03:13.547 --> 00:03:15.069
She didn't cause this!

00:03:16.155 --> 00:03:17.154
Make it stop!

00:03:17.322 --> 00:03:20.665
<i>This is Captain Reid speaking.
All passengers and flight attendants</i>

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:23.118
Please take your seats,
fasten your seat belts.

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.119
I knew something
like this would happen.

00:03:28.244 --> 00:03:30.644
All the great ones
go down in planes.

00:03:31.128 --> 00:03:34.171
<i>We've been cleared for an
emergency landing. Please remain calm.</i>

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:40.885
All I cared about was being successful,
and now I'm gonna die

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:43.597
and I never got married
Or had children!

00:03:43.766 --> 00:03:45.672
And I never won a daytime Emmy!

00:03:45.797 --> 00:03:49.801
Not even the season I so courageously
battled Lyme disease!

00:03:50.486 --> 00:03:52.445
And I've never done
anything impulsive

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:55.526
except get on this plane
and look where that got me!

00:03:55.694 --> 00:03:58.044
<i>I need everyone to brace for impact.</i>

00:03:58.391 --> 00:04:01.448
- I love you guys.
- I love you too.

00:04:01.617 --> 00:04:05.369
And I swear that if I survive this,
I am going to stop being so vain.

00:04:05.538 --> 00:04:07.731
And scared of everything.

00:04:07.856 --> 00:04:11.860
And I'm never gonna complain
about anything ever, ever again.

00:04:15.125 --> 00:04:17.214
<i>We have safely landed in Cleveland.</i>

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:19.240
Cleveland?

00:04:21.262 --> 00:04:23.540
Hot In Cleveland 1x01
"Pilot"

00:04:23.665 --> 00:04:26.288
Hot In Tracksuit Team
www.forom.com

00:04:26.413 --> 00:04:29.143
Logdo, Thirteen, Skualler
and Sososeries

00:04:29.955 --> 00:04:31.979
Great. My husband's engaged

00:04:32.147 --> 00:04:34.062
and we're in a dive bar
in Cleveland.

00:04:34.187 --> 00:04:37.887
I googled Cleveland and get hammered,
And this is what came up.

00:04:38.012 --> 00:04:41.363
Along with some very disturbing
pictures of Drew Carey.

00:04:44.401 --> 00:04:47.119
Why are the men looking
at us like that?

00:04:47.288 --> 00:04:50.683
No, I get recognized a lot,
