00:04:51.375 --> 00:04:53.325
I remember that look. It's...

00:04:54.254 --> 00:04:55.254
Desire.

00:04:57.697 --> 00:04:59.297
They're looking at us.

00:05:00.069 --> 00:05:01.919
In L.A., they look past us.

00:05:02.925 --> 00:05:04.887
- Ladies.
- How you doing?

00:05:08.642 --> 00:05:10.292
I feel young and hot...

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:15.069
Like they're undressing me with
their eyes and not finding spanx.

00:05:15.632 --> 00:05:18.317
To think that we spend
all that time and effort

00:05:18.442 --> 00:05:20.342
and money trying
to look ten years younger

00:05:20.467 --> 00:05:23.656
and ten pounds lighter, and all we had
to do was crash-land in Cleveland.

00:05:24.794 --> 00:05:27.303
Where all the men look like real men

00:05:27.428 --> 00:05:29.620
and the women look like real women.

00:05:30.044 --> 00:05:32.744
And everyone's eating
and no one's ashamed.

00:05:34.782 --> 00:05:36.543
I'm gonna order chili fries.

00:05:38.785 --> 00:05:40.297
Are your chili fries good?

00:05:40.624 --> 00:05:42.224
Can Lebron James jump?

00:05:44.013 --> 00:05:45.513
Can who do what now?

00:05:47.021 --> 00:05:48.171
They're good.

00:05:48.506 --> 00:05:50.506
We'll have three orders and...

00:05:51.384 --> 00:05:52.984
Three not-light beers.

00:05:54.063 --> 00:05:56.563
Coming right up, and the guys
