- Hi, Hank. Melanie.

00:06:37.398 --> 00:06:38.897
- I'm bill.
- James.

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:41.525
- And this is Joy and I'm...
- We know who you are.

00:06:41.787 --> 00:06:43.038
Victoria Chase.

00:06:43.329 --> 00:06:46.091
I got addicted to edge of tomorrow
One summer I got laid up.

00:06:46.216 --> 00:06:49.533
The year you were Honor Saint Raven
and her evil sister Silver Saint Raven.

00:06:49.702 --> 00:06:52.953
And her even eviler sister
