00:07:02.693 --> 00:07:03.793
Susan Lucci.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:05.716
Finally!

00:07:06.868 --> 00:07:09.218
So, Melanie, are you an actress too?

00:07:10.972 --> 00:07:12.422
Well, you could be.

00:07:12.547 --> 00:07:16.119
You remind me of that really
pretty actress who was in that...

00:07:16.244 --> 00:07:18.396
that movie.
I can't remember her name.

00:07:18.521 --> 00:07:19.980
It doesn't matter.

00:07:23.464 --> 00:07:25.232
So what brings you guys here?

00:07:25.357 --> 00:07:27.279
Actually, we're on our way to Paris.

00:07:27.448 --> 00:07:28.916
Melanie wrote this book called

00:07:29.041 --> 00:07:31.190
