00:07:38.295 --> 00:07:41.043
A writer and an actress.
So what do you do?

00:07:41.421 --> 00:07:44.046
You're looking at the eyebrow
queen of Beverly hills.

00:07:44.398 --> 00:07:46.048
I do a lot of celebrities.

00:07:46.216 --> 00:07:47.270
Mostly women.

00:07:47.395 --> 00:07:49.608
Oprah, Cher, Ryan Seacrest.

00:07:53.699 --> 00:07:54.848
