00:07:57.269 --> 00:07:58.525
At the moment.

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:00.604
Melanie's going
through a divorce, and

00:08:00.772 --> 00:08:02.815
Victoria's been married,
like, 20 times.

00:08:02.983 --> 00:08:06.110
