00:08:07.686 --> 00:08:08.890
Here we go, ladies.

00:08:12.951 --> 00:08:14.351
Only cheese fries?

00:08:14.476 --> 00:08:16.924
You girls are light eaters, huh?

00:08:19.875 --> 00:08:21.024
To Cleveland!

00:08:27.954 --> 00:08:29.633
God, what were we thinking?

00:08:29.802 --> 00:08:32.420
Alcohol and salt and trans fats?

00:08:33.586 --> 00:08:37.589
