00:09:08.324 --> 00:09:10.024
I'm moving to Cleveland.

00:09:11.945 --> 00:09:13.745
You're such a little slut.

00:09:15.774 --> 00:09:17.139
I know, right?

00:09:18.854 --> 00:09:22.639
Oh, my God. You guys,
Hank is so amazing and sweet.

00:09:23.271 --> 00:09:25.321
He told me that I was luscious.

00:09:26.996 --> 00:09:28.696
He said I was delicious.

00:09:29.644 --> 00:09:32.144
I tell you,
it's the French fry grease.

00:09:35.278 --> 00:09:36.528
He's a plumber.

00:09:37.377 --> 00:09:38.758
Right? Right?

00:09:38.883 --> 00:09:40.994
I mean, how many times
have we fantasized

00:09:41.119 --> 00:09:43.769
about a man who could
actually fix things?

00:09:44.471 --> 00:09:46.078
He showed me all around Cleveland

00:09:46.203 --> 00:09:48.295
and I'm telling you,
It's nothing like we think.

00:09:48.654 --> 00:09:51.129
They have symphonies
and museums and light opera.

00:09:51.254 --> 00:09:54.615
Okay, so nobody really likes
those things, but they have 'em!

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.261
