00:09:56.525 --> 00:09:58.388
But you've lost your freaking mind.

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:01.986
I'm telling you,
I'm moving to Cleveland.

00:10:02.111 --> 00:10:04.895
Melanie, friends don't
let friends move to Cleveland.

