00:10:18.526 --> 00:10:21.720
Well, that price has got
to be missing a zero.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:23.509
Oh, my God.

00:10:23.634 --> 00:10:25.326
I know, right?
It's amazing?

00:10:25.451 --> 00:10:27.351
No, it's a picture of Oprah.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:29.796
Look at those brows.

00:10:30.193 --> 00:10:31.643
That's not my arch.

00:10:32.011 --> 00:10:34.132
She's being plucked by someone else.

00:10:34.427 --> 00:10:36.078
It was probably retouched.

00:10:36.203 --> 00:10:38.011
I mean, I get all of my photos...

00:10:38.136 --> 00:10:40.586
I mean, I hear that people
do do that.

00:10:41.811 --> 00:10:45.661
I've built my business on being
the salon that does Oprah's brows.

00:10:45.864 --> 00:10:48.186
This is the work
of that Russian chick on rodeo.

00:10:48.311 --> 00:10:49.711
Bloody Foreigners.

00:10:52.377 --> 00:10:54.945
Well, would looking at
cheap real estate cheer you up?

00:10:55.376 --> 00:10:59.011
Probably not, but I just can't
lie here licking my wounds.

00:10:59.761 --> 00:11:00.811
Although...

00:11:06.874 --> 00:11:08.574
I love it. I'll take it.

00:11:09.153 --> 00:11:10.460
What are you doing?

00:11:10.629 --> 00:11:12.859
We're getting on a plane
for Paris tomorrow.

00:11:12.984 --> 00:11:15.994
I was going to Paris to find romance,
but I've found it here,

00:11:16.119 --> 00:11:18.135
