00:11:19.285 --> 00:11:20.554
This is crazy.

00:11:20.722 --> 00:11:22.544
Look, it's a month-to-month lease,

00:11:22.669 --> 00:11:24.924
And a month here costs
the same as a night in Paris.

00:11:25.049 --> 00:11:26.685
- Here you go.
- And here you go.

00:11:26.853 --> 00:11:30.397
Now there's just one thing about
this place that I should mention.

00:11:30.745 --> 00:11:33.045
Why are you renting to prostitutes?

00:11:38.332 --> 00:11:40.055
This is Elka Ostrovsky.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:42.233
She's a caretaker
who comes with the house,

00:11:42.358 --> 00:11:43.906
If you wish to retain her.

00:11:44.031 --> 00:11:46.321
