00:12:04.186 --> 00:12:05.682
- I wouldn't...
- No worries.

00:12:05.851 --> 00:12:09.300
If you can escape from the Nazis,
you can handle anything.

00:12:10.964 --> 00:12:12.773
You escaped from the Nazis?

00:12:13.032 --> 00:12:16.182
Escaping from the Nazis
was the least of my worries.

00:12:18.309 --> 00:12:20.709
Well, you don't
hear that very often.

00:12:21.687 --> 00:12:23.537
So what are you, like, 100?

00:12:24.897 --> 00:12:26.247
