00:12:55.388 --> 00:12:56.988
Then what's it to you?

00:13:00.396 --> 00:13:03.281
I can't wait to tell Hank.
He said he'd call.

00:13:03.559 --> 00:13:05.359
They all say they'll call.

00:13:10.959 --> 00:13:12.409
It's him. It's him.

00:13:14.253 --> 00:13:15.553
That's shameful.

00:13:16.143 --> 00:13:19.409
I haven't even looked
at another man since 1949.

00:13:20.953 --> 00:13:23.003
When the husband dies, you die.

00:13:23.303 --> 00:13:24.803
But you're not dead.

00:13:25.886 --> 00:13:27.136
Inside you die.

00:13:28.511 --> 00:13:30.942
Oh, you still maintain the Shell.

00:13:36.776 --> 00:13:40.335
I have a date.
My first date in 25 years.

00:13:40.624 --> 00:13:42.881
He wants me to meet him
