for some guy you met at a bar?

00:14:18.108 --> 00:14:20.108
I mean, what do you
even know about this guy?

00:14:20.452 --> 00:14:22.702
I know that
I've never felt so alive.

00:14:22.827 --> 00:14:25.177
And you know what?
Maybe at our age,

00:14:25.302 --> 00:14:27.365
we're just supposed
to pounce on these things.

00:14:28.379 --> 00:14:29.659
My kids are in college.

00:14:29.828 --> 00:14:32.000
